{"title":"1972 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of solutions to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e9f28037c8e83a03c093762d3192a04bcb9d13f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,~2\\}\\subseteq~X~\\subseteq~\\{1,~2,~3,~4,~5\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"248\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is a subset of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/7/d27ba972ade647d96e846415aac7c157569a6f9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,~2,~3,~4,~5\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/7/3a7f242cf3840caa4a54a3b5f6e64edafba7df01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }4\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }6\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }8\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"442\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> has to contain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/e/40ed7e48f0e1405206c1284134dc98ebebe58594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,~2\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" />, so only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/9/029899f2b55032a2889ba517632e3723cc97365d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{3,~4,~5\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> matters. There are two choices for the elements; the element is either in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> or outside of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. With this combinatorics in mind, the answer is simply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/0307678528b81014cc5664d8037159327f0b6d76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }8}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"100\" height=\"28\" /> ~lopkiloinm\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171016\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1937/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19982:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017171016 and revision id 136873. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}